OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy this
OL,6,Fevening with rain, heavy and
OL,7,Fpersistent in the west but drier
OL,8,Faround Inverness and Nairn. Clearer
OL,9,Fweather reaching the far northwest
OL,10,Fbefore midnight will follow south to
OL,11,Fall overnight with scattered showers
OL,12,Ffollowing.
OL,13,
OL,14,CSunday:FA bright day with sunny spells
OL,15,Fand a few scattered showers. The
OL,16,Fshowers turning more frequent for
OL,17,FCaithness and Sutherland in the
OL,18,Fevening where it will be rather breezy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
